00:00:56.744 --> 00:00:57.878
A potential indictment come?

00:00:58.779 --> 00:00:59.813
I think the jury is still out

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:00.214
on that.

00:01:00.781 --> 00:01:02.883
I also think that trump

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:04.017
